l of the Colossi</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Deeper%20Catacombs\">Deeper Catacombs</a> (on the way to <a href=\"#/wiki/Koshei%20the%20Deathless\">Koshei the Deathless</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Magician%20Quarter\">Magician Quarter</a> Efreet Territory, <a href=\"#/wiki/Magician%20Quarter\">Magician Quarter</a> (Demon cave), <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth%2FCastle\">Vengoth Castle</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Talahu\">Talahu</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Medusa%20Cave\">Medusa Cave</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Mutated%20Zalamon\">Mutated Zalamon's</a> room, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Rock\">Lion's Rock</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>A snake ornament carved into a stone floor.<br/><br/>It can appear in various different lengths and arrangements, for example:<br/><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Snake Ornament Arrangement\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Snake_Ornament_Arrangement_5d040a.png\" width=\"160\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Flooring</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/lions-rock-quest\">Lion's Rock Quest</a></li><li>Tiles</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["lions-rock-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"lions-rock-quest","quest":"Lion's Rock Quest","step":"3-4","n":14,"title":"Inscrição 3: cobra (amarelo)","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33114,"y":32296,"z":9,"label":"Escadas para descer"},{"x":33121,"y":32280,"z":10,"label":"Escadas para subir (zona noroeste)"},{"x":33095,"y":32244,"z":9,"label":"Snake Ornament"}]}]}}